  "format": "gai-icon/2",
  "id": "network-switch",
  "label": "Network switch",
  "intent": "The network switch forwards a packet from one port to another. Light: a data packet drops onto the switch above the first port and fades as it lands, the port lights flash across the row in turn, and the packet rises out above the last port and fades. Strong: two transfers, one each way: a packet comes in over the first port and leaves over the last, then a second comes in over the middle port, flashes back across and leaves over the first, travelling further. The case never moves.",
